    "advancement": [],
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You become wholly suffused with the forest's ancient power, granting you the following benefits. </p><p><strong>Persistent Hunt.</strong> If you drop to 0 Hit Points while transformed using Wrath of the Wild and don't die outright, you can expend a level 4+ spell slot (no action required). Your Hit Points then instead change to an amount equal to five times the level of the spell slot expended. </p><p><strong>Timeless.</strong> You have Immunity to the Exhaustion condition.</p>",
